  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The right antibiotic at the right dose and the right time can mean the difference between life and death for a patient with a serious bacterial infection. Unfortunately, even in the face of growing antibiotic resistance, many health systems&#x2014;particularly in low- and middle-income countries&#x2014;do not have reliable access to effective antibiotics. GARDP is taking action during late-stage antibiotic development and after approval so that antibiotics are accessible to people in need of all ages, wherever they live.</narrative>
  </description>
